ong> Option-cum-Preference Form?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> It is a form where you select your <strong data-end=\"249\" data-start=\"227\">post (Grade C / D)</strong> and <strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"254\">department preferences</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> When is the<strong> form released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> It is released <strong data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"382\">after the skill test (stenography test)</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Where can I <strong>fill the form?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> On the official <strong data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"531\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Staff Selection Commission</span></span> (SSC)</strong> website</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is it mandatory to<strong> fill this form?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Without it, you may <strong data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"740\">not be considered for final allocation</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSC</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSC </strong></span>is <strong>https://ssc.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"SSC Stenographer Option Cum Preference Form 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-34417 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-06T104241.957-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-06T104241.957-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-06T104241.957-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-06T104241.957-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-06T104241.957.jpg 1200w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.